%% Shop: generated from its Statechart; do not edit by hand.
stateDiagram-v2
  Unopened : before the season starts
  Trading : the operator's turn
  Closing : customers are shopping
  SeasonOver : ended: the season ran its course
  Bankrupt : ended: the till couldn't pay the fee
  [*] --> Unopened
  Unopened --> Trading : OpenShop / ShopOpened
  Trading --> Trading : OrderStock / StockOrdered
  Trading --> Trading : StockMachine / MachineStocked
  Trading --> Trading : SetPrice / PriceSet
  Trading --> Closing : WaitForNextDay / DayClosed
  Closing --> Trading : RecordSales / SalesRecorded, FeeCharged, StockDelivered, DayOpened
  Closing --> SeasonOver : RecordSales / SalesRecorded, FeeCharged, SeasonEnded
  Closing --> Bankrupt : RecordSales / SalesRecorded, WentBankrupt
  SeasonOver --> [*]
  Bankrupt --> [*]
  note right of Unopened
    OrderStock refused (NotTrading)
    StockMachine refused (NotTrading)
    SetPrice refused (NotTrading)
    WaitForNextDay refused (NotTrading)
    RecordSales does nothing
  end note
  note right of Trading
    OpenShop refused (AlreadyOpen)
    OrderStock refused (UnknownProduct, InsufficientCash)
    StockMachine refused (UnknownProduct, NotEnoughInStorage)
    SetPrice refused (UnknownProduct)
    RecordSales does nothing
    SetPrice does nothing
  end note
  note right of Closing
    OpenShop refused (AlreadyOpen)
    OrderStock refused (NotTrading)
    StockMachine refused (NotTrading)
    SetPrice refused (NotTrading)
    WaitForNextDay refused (NotTrading)
    RecordSales does nothing
  end note
  note right of SeasonOver
    OpenShop refused (AlreadyOpen)
    OrderStock refused (NotTrading)
    StockMachine refused (NotTrading)
    SetPrice refused (NotTrading)
    WaitForNextDay refused (NotTrading)
    RecordSales does nothing
  end note
  note right of Bankrupt
    OpenShop refused (AlreadyOpen)
    OrderStock refused (NotTrading)
    StockMachine refused (NotTrading)
    SetPrice refused (NotTrading)
    WaitForNextDay refused (NotTrading)
    RecordSales does nothing
  end note
